Dear Brent,

=20

I would like all the transcripts of the trial please.

=20

Any deviations from the recording or the transcripts should be highlighted =
by you, for example I did not agree to all the watches, and it is on the cou=
rt records. I also said twice that I did not have an extra marital affair. I=
t is also on the court record.

=20

On the court record, the respondent lied about his Oxus. Oxus and Nourza ar=
e part of the marital pot, they are not outside.

=20

Please do not submit anything to the judge until it is approved by me.

=20

Please advise what the appeal process is. I intend to appeal now.

=20

I am contacting the relevant people and will let you know when this is out.

=20

With kind wishes,

Nadia

=20

=20

BV20D01752

Fraud Unravels All=20

Veritas Numquam Perit

UK: +44 79 1332 8615

US: +1 424 426 9226

=20

=20

=20

=20

=20

On 10/04/2024, 5:51=E2=80=AFPM, "Brent Molyneux KC" <BMolyneux@29br.co.uk> wrote:

=20

=20

Dear Nadia

I hope you're well.

I will submit a list of typographical corrections (as requested by the judg=
e).=20

My intention was to draft an order reflective of the Judgment - if you don'=
t want me to do that, can you let me know, because we would have to let the =
Judge's clerk know.

Please don't think that me not communicating with you more extensively is r=
udeness on my part; it's simply that I don't do direct access work and so ca=
n't do much more on your case without a solicitor to instruct me (indeed, I'=
m not allowed to or insured to).

I do understand the Judgment will have been disappointing for you and am of=
 course sending you my best wishes

Brent=20

(I have copied this to Zoe out of courtesy, and to my senior clerk James, s=
o he can see what I have explained to you)

=20

Sent from Outlook for iOS


Brent Molyneux KC - Barrister=20

Chambers of Alexis Campbell KC and Nicholas Allen KC=20

A 29 Bedford Row, London WC1R 4HE DX LDE 1044=20
T 020 7404 1044 E bmolyneux@29br.co.uk=20

